        "chinese_description": "一种流行的阴谋论认为，泰坦尼克号的沉没是保险欺诈的一部分。根据这一理论，某些投资者或公司可能购买了巨额保险，然后故意让船只沉没以获取赔偿。这种说法的依据之一是泰坦尼克号的保险金额异常高，远超其实际价值。然而，历史记录显示，虽然泰坦尼克号确实投保了巨额保险，但其价值和保险金额之间的差距并不足以支持这种欺诈行为的动机。"
      },
      {
        "type": "elimination of key figures",
        "description": "Another theory involves a more complex conspiracy, suggesting that the sinking was to eliminate some important figures on board who posed a threat to certain power groups. This theory often links to other major historical events, attempting to construct a larger conspiracy network. However, this claim lacks solid historical evidence and is more based on speculation and reinterpretation of historical events.",
